tg-channel is a modified copy of the Telegram channel plugin from
anthropics/claude-plugins-official (plugin "telegram", version 0.0.7),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes from the original:
- server.ts: inbound channel messages carry `reply_to_message_id`, the id of
  the message they reply to, when they reply to one.
- The plugin manifest, .mcp.json and the access/configure skills are left out:
  examples/claude-telegram/claude-telegram starts server.ts as the MCP server
  `tg-channel` through --mcp-config. Pairing and access.json stay as the
  official plugin's /telegram:access skill manages them.
